          "narration": "The vertical component, Vy, equals the magnitude of V times the sine of theta. Together, Vx and Vy form a right triangle with V as the hypotenuse."
        },
        {
          "clipName": "clip4",
          "audioClip": "components_reconstruct",
          "autoAdvance": false,
          "changes": [
