          "changeMeaning": "The main vector V is emphasized alongside its components to reinforce the reconstruction relationship via the Pythagorean theorem and arctangent.",
          "narration": "Using the Pythagorean theorem, the magnitude of V is the square root of Vx squared plus Vy squared, and the angle theta is the arctangent of Vy over Vx. From components, we can always reconstruct the original vector."
